     corpora — so this applies to seeds, gen_seeds and gen_perf alike.
  9. PER-MODULE DUPLICATE TYPES (c2rust gotcha): c2rust emits the SAME C
     struct as a DISTINCT Rust type in EVERY module that references it —
     e.g. `json_tokener::json_object`, `json_patch::json_object` and
